# retroforge: Wi-Fi power save as the board profile asks (issue #27). /etc/machine-id is empty on a
# fresh image, so systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the stock 99-default.preset is
# "disable *"; this keeps it enabled. A build-time multi-user.target.wants link ships alongside as a
# fallback (cf. 60-retroforge-powerbuttond.preset).
enable retroforge-wifi-powersave.service
